Package: homelab-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-requests
Description: Command-line client for the Homelab API
 A site-admin scripting tool for the Homelab Drive REST API: login/session
 management with automatic JWT refresh, and one subcommand per API call
 covering Drive file/directory operations, sharing, bulk operations, and
 site_admin role/user administration.
